  "prefLabel": "En 3003.04 Reporting Requirements of Competitive Natural Gas Suppliers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 3003.04 Reporting Requirements of Competitive Natural Gas Suppliers.\n\n(a) Each CNGS shall file one original, one paper copy, and one electronic copy with the department, annually, by no later than March 1 of each year, a report of its sales in the prior calendar.\n\n(b) The report required by (a) above in this section shall include:\n\n(1) The name of and responsible reporting agent for the CNGS;\n\n(2) The date of the report;\n\n(3) The year covered in the report;\n\n(4) The number of New Hampshire customers, by rate class, by month, with annual totals; and\n\n(5) Sales volumes to New Hampshire customers, in dekatherm units, by rate class, by month, with annual totals.\n\n(c) With each application for renewal, each CNGS shall file, on a confidential basis, a report listing any aggregators currently using the CNGS to provide service to New Hampshire customers, and the number of customers served by each listed aggregator.\n\nSource. #14593, eff 5-21-26, EXPIRES: 5-21-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/en3000.html"
